docs {
  Hosted Dev setup, /api/local-dev/** tooling endpoints, and admin moderation helpers.

  Privileged requests require the allowlisted Google administrator, verified Web App Check, and a current TOTP grant.

  Follow the README for environment setup and the request order. Send individual requests because this folder includes Dev mutations.
